flowchart TB
  A[PayKings NMI merchant webhook] --> B{Verify raw-body HMAC, merchant and event ID}
  S[Optional Stripe merchant webhook] --> C{Verify timestamped Stripe signature}
  B --> D[Neon preregistered trusted first-party checkout intents]
  C --> D
  D --> E{Captured or settled, amount/transaction match, approved?}
  E -->|No| R[Reconciliation and manual review]
  E -->|Yes| F[Transaction: grant + Postgres job + durable outbox]
  F --> G[Persistent outbox relay to BullMQ]
  G --> H[Owned node scheduler]
  H --> I[Existing first-party worker: original previews and owned QA only]
  I --> J[Delivery verification and customer acceptance]
  P[Authorized owned SOCKS5 health paths] --> Q[Probe Litix-owned HTTPS health endpoint]
  Q --> T[Neon signed-in owner telemetry]
  H --> T
  T --> U[Owner-only React terminal]
